1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:02,720
(Howard:)Ma?

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:05,450
(Howard:)You too busy bearing down?

3
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:09,590
(Howard:)Ma?

4
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:13,490
(Howard:)Oh, my God, Ma? Ma? Ma?

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,560
(Howard:)Stand back,
I'm gonna break the door down!

6
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,740
(Howard:)Son of a bitch!
Ma, help!

7
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,280
(Penny:)Hey.

8
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:31,610
(Sheldon:)Hello.

9
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:32,880
(Penny:)Haven't
seen you in a while.

10
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:34,210
(Penny:)How's it going?

11
00:00:34,210 --> 00:00:37,680
(Sheldon:)Oh, other than waiting out
the exponential growth period

12
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:39,550
(Sheldon:)of the virulent organisms

13
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:41,220
(Sheldon:)trooping through
my microvilli

14
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:45,490
(Sheldon:)into my circulatory system--
hunky-dory.

15
00:00:50,690 --> 00:00:52,030
(Sheldon:)Did I say something
amusing?

16
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:55,730
(Penny:)I don't know, maybe,
I have no idea what you said.

17
00:00:55,730 --> 00:00:59,160
(Sheldon:)So your mirth is merely
a discharge of nervous energy

